</div>


<div id="site-header"></div>

<main id="main">

<!-- ═══════ HERO ═══════ -->
<section class="faq-page-hero">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:720px">
    <nav class="breadcrumb reveal reveal--up" data-delay="0" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a><span>›</span><span aria-current="page">FAQs</span>
    </nav>
    <p class="eyebrow reveal reveal--up" data-delay="1">Knowledge Base</p>
    <h1 class="reveal reveal--up" data-delay="2">Frequently Asked<br><em style="font-style:normal;color:var(--amber)">Questions</em></h1>
    <p class="reveal reveal--up" data-delay="3">Got questions? We've got answers about your iCAUR journey.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════ CATEGORY FILTERS ═══════ -->
<div class="faq-cat-filters">
  <button class="faq-cat-btn is-active" data-cat="all">All FAQs</button>
  <button class="faq-cat-btn" data-cat="sales">Sales</button>
  <button class="faq-cat-btn" data-cat="warranty">Warranty</button>
  <button class="faq-cat-btn" data-cat="services">Services</button>
  <button class="faq-cat-btn" data-cat="spare-parts">Spare Parts</button>
</div>

<!-- ═══════ FAQ BODY ═══════ -->
<div class="faq-page-body">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">

    <!-- Sales -->
    <div class="faq-group" data-group="sales">
      <div class="faq-item reveal reveal--up" role="listitem">
        <button type="button" class="faq-item__q" aria-expanded="false">How far does V27 go?<span class="faq-item__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-item__a" aria-hidden="true"><div><p>The V27 delivers 500 km of real-world range on a single charge. That's enough to get you across Egypt without breaking a sweat — even with AC on in summer.</p></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal reveal--up" role="listitem">
        <button type="button" class="faq-item__q" aria-expanded="false">How do I place a reservation?<span class="faq-item__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-item__a" aria-hidden="true"><div><p>Visit our <a href="/reserve" style="color:var(--brown)">Reserve page</a> and complete the form. A fully-refundable deposit of 50,000 EGP secures your place — no commitment until you're ready to finalize your order.</p></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal reveal--up" role="listitem">
        <button type="button" class="faq-item__q" aria-expanded="false">Is the deposit refundable?<span class="faq-item__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-item__a" aria-hidden="true"><div><p>Yes — 100%. Your reservation deposit is fully refundable at any time before final order confirmation, no questions asked.</p></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal reveal--up" role="listitem">
        <button type="button" class="faq-item__q" aria-expanded="false">What's the starting price?<span class="faq-item__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-item__a" aria-hidden="true"><div><p>The V27 starts from 1,800,000 EGP and the V23 from 2,100,000 EGP. Exact pricing varies by trim level. Contact our team for a full quote tailored to your configuration.</p></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal reveal--up" role="listitem">
        <button type="button" class="faq-item__q" aria-expanded="false">Can I schedule a test drive?<span class="faq-item__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-item__a" aria-hidden="true"><div><p>Absolutely. Test drives are available at all three showroom locations. Book via the <a href="/contact" style="color:var(--brown)">contact form</a> or visit any iCAUR showroom directly.</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Warranty -->
    <div class="faq-group" data-group="warranty">
      <div class="faq-item reveal reveal--up" role="listitem">
        <button type="button" class="faq-item__q" aria-expanded="false">What warranty comes standard?<span class="faq-item__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-item__a" aria-hidden="true"><div><p>Every iCAUR comes with a comprehensive 5-year / 150,000 km bumper-to-bumper warranty, plus an 8-year / 200,000 km battery warranty. Extended plans are available.</p></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal reveal--up" role="listitem">
        <button type="button" class="faq-item__q" aria-expanded="false">Does the warranty cover battery degradation?<span class="faq-item__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-item__a" aria-hidden="true"><div><p>Yes. If your battery drops below 70% of its original capacity within the 8-year warranty period, iCAUR will repair or replace it at no charge.</p></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal reveal--up" role="listitem">
        <button type="button" class="faq-item__q" aria-expanded="false">Can I transfer the warranty if I sell the car?<span class="faq-item__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-item__a" aria-hidden="true"><div><p>Yes. All iCAUR warranties are fully transferable to subsequent owners within the coverage period, adding significant resale value to your vehicle.</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Services -->
    <div class="faq-group" data-group="services">
      <div class="faq-item reveal reveal--up" role="listitem">
        <button type="button" class="faq-item__q" aria-expanded="false">How long to charge fully?<span class="faq-item__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-item__a" aria-hidden="true"><div><p>Using a DC fast charger (150 kW), the V27 reaches 80% in approximately 28 minutes. A full charge via standard AC (22 kW) takes around 4 hours overnight — perfect for home charging.</p></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal reveal--up" role="listitem">
        <button type="button" class="faq-item__q" aria-expanded="false">Can I charge at home?<span class="faq-item__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-item__a" aria-hidden="true"><div><p>Yes. iCAUR provides a home charging unit with every vehicle purchase. Our team will assess your home and handle the installation — typically completed within 3–5 business days.</p></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal reveal--up" role="listitem">
        <button type="button" class="faq-item__q" aria-expanded="false">Is there a test drive available?<span class="faq-item__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-item__a" aria-hidden="true"><div><p>Yes. All three iCAUR showrooms offer test drives 7 days a week. Book online via the contact form, or simply walk in during business hours.</p></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal reveal--up" role="listitem">
        <button type="button" class="faq-item__q" aria-expanded="false">How do I book a service appointment?<span class="faq-item__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-item__a" aria-hidden="true"><div><p>Use the iCAUR mobile app to schedule maintenance in seconds. You can also call your nearest service center or visit our <a href="/contact" style="color:var(--brown)">contact page</a> to book online.</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Spare Parts -->
    <div class="faq-group" data-group="spare-parts">
      <div class="faq-item reveal reveal--up" role="listitem">
        <button type="button" class="faq-item__q" aria-expanded="false">Are iCAUR spare parts available in Egypt?<span class="faq-item__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-item__a" aria-hidden="true"><div><p>Yes. iCAUR maintains a comprehensive local parts inventory across all authorized service centers in Egypt. Most common parts can be sourced within 24–48 hours.</p></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal reveal--up" role="listitem">
        <button type="button" class="faq-item__q" aria-expanded="false">Can I use third-party parts?<span class="faq-item__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-item__a" aria-hidden="true"><div><p>We strongly recommend using genuine iCAUR parts for all repairs to maintain your warranty and optimal performance. Third-party parts may void warranty coverage for affected systems.</p></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal reveal--up" role="listitem">
        <button type="button" class="faq-item__q" aria-expanded="false">How long does a parts order take?<span class="faq-item__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-item__a" aria-hidden="true"><div><p>Standard parts from our local inventory ship same day. Specialty or non-stocked items typically arrive within 5–10 business days from our regional distribution center.</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

<!-- ═══════ CTA SPLIT ═══════ -->
<section class="cta-video" id="cta">
  <video class="cta-video__bg" src="/assets/images/CTA-bg.mp4" poster="/assets/images/CTA.jpg" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" aria-hidden="true"></video>
  <div class="cta-video__overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="cta-video__glass reveal reveal--up">
    <span class="cta-video__dash" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <h2 class="cta-video__h">Ready For The <em>Next Step</em></h2>
    <p class="cta-video__body">The V27 is waiting — let's get you behind the wheel.</p>
    <div class="cta-video__actions">
      <a href="/reserve" class="btn btn--filled btn--lg btn--arrow btn--magnetic">Reserve Your iCAUR <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--outline btn--arrow btn--magnetic">Send Us Message <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</main>

<div id="site-footer"></div>

<script>
// Category filter
document.querySelectorAll('.faq-cat-btn').forEach(btn => {
  btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
    document.querySelectorAll('.faq-cat-btn').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('is-active'));
    btn.classList.add('is-active');
    const cat = btn.dataset.cat;
    document.querySelectorAll('.faq-group').forEach(g => {
      g.style.display = (cat === 'all' || g.dataset.group === cat) ? '' : 'none';
    });
  });
});

// FAQ accordion (one open at a time) is handled globally in /js/main.js
</script>

<script src="/js/components.js" defer></script>
<script src="/js/main.js" defer></script>
  <script src="/js/transitions.js" defer></script>
<script src="/js/game.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
